RE ORACLE_MAINTAINED = \'Y\')          AND GRANTEE NOT IN (\'ETL\')','The GRANT ANY ROLE  grant is correctly set . \r','The  GRANT ANY ROLE  grant is not correctly set . ','pass',NULL,NULL,'2026-01-01 12:46:43'),(11,202601,2,101,'AA_Oracle_400_Check Oracle Sample Users Removed','critical','OTHER','This test checks the sample user accounts that have been removed. These default sample accounts created by Oracle that have well-known passwords can be potentially used to alter or damage the database. These accounts should be removed after confirming that the sample schemas are really sample schemas.   CIS 4.2    ','','SELECT count(*)   FROM ALL_USERS   WHERE USERNAME IN (\'BI\',\'HR\',\'IX\',\'OE\',\'PM\',\'SCOTT\',\'SH\')','== 0','','SELECT USERNAME   FROM ALL_USERS   WHERE USERNAME IN (\'BI\',\'HR\',\'IX\',\'OE\',\'PM\',\'SCOTT\',\'SH\')','All sample users are removed\r','There are sample users which must be removed in this database','pass',NULL,NULL,'2026-01-01 12:46:43'),(12,202601,2,104,'AA_Oracle_420_Oracle System privileges for Developers and Analysts','critical','OTHER','Production databases should be protected from unauthorized access by developers on shared production/development host systems. Developers granted elevated database, operating system privileges on systems that support both development, and production databases can affect the operation and/or security of the production database system. Operating system and database privileges like \'CREATE%\', \'ALTER%\' or \'DROP%\' that are assigned to developers on shared development and production systems should be restricted.  This test excludes grantees from a predefined Guardium group called \"Oracle exclude default system grantees\" and APEX_.  This test also excludes grantees that are ANONYMOUS and PUBLIC.  To exclude certain grantees, you can create an exception group, populate it with authorized grantees and link your group to this test.','','SELECT  count(*)     FROM dba_sys_privs    WHERE     PRIVILEGE NOT IN (\'CREATE SESSION\')           AND GRANTEE IN (\'AOZCAM\',                          \'BACOSKUN\',                          \'BASEZGIN\',                          \'BECE\',                          \'BKOCADAG\',                          \'BTIMUR\',                          \'COZBAKAN\',                          \'CZGHEIB\',                          \'DAKSOY\',                          \'DISIK\',                          \'DKAHRAMANL\',                          \'EALGUL\',                          \'EARTUC\',                          \'EGURLEYEN\',                          \'EOZKAL\',                          \'EZCALIS\',                          \'FHELVACIOG\',                          \'FLOGOGLU\',                          \'FSSARIKAYA\',                          \'HBINGOL\',                          \'HCENGIZ\',                          \'HTOPTAS\',                          \'HYASSIBAS_EM\',                          \'IDEMIRTAS\',                          \'JNASR\',                          \'KABICHEDID\',                          \'KKALAANY\',                          \'KKARAGOZ\',                          \'MEVREN\',                          \'MSUSAKLI\',                          \'MUSSIMSEK\',                          \'NAKSOY\',                          \'NOYAT\',                          \'OBAYDIN\',                          \'OFSACIOBANU\',                          \'OFSACOLNICEANU\',                          \'OFSAMARASOIU\',                          \'OFSAMIHAI\',                          \'OFSANICULAE\',                          \'OFSAOHII\',                          \'OFSAPANTILIE\',                          \'OKARACA\',                          \'OMCETIN\',                          \'ONBOZKAYA\',                          \'OPERCIN\',                          \'OSARICAOGL\',                          \'OYURDUSEV\',                          \'OZGDURAK\',                          \'PEKMEKCI\',                          \'PIYALDIZ\',                          \'SBAYRAKTAR\',                          \'SDESEN\',                          \'SEONEY\',                          \'SKIZILKAYA\',                          \'SOFLAS\',                          \'SOZORAL\',                          \'SSAROHAN\',                          \'SSUSLER\',                          \'TAKTURK\',                          \'TKASDAS\',                          \'TSAYAN\',                          \'TUVURAL\',                          \'UEMRE\',                          \'VDEMIR\',                          \'YBOZCAM\')','== 0','','SELECT distinct grantee     FROM dba_sys_privs    WHERE     PRIVILEGE NOT IN (\'CREATE SESSION\')          AND GRANTEE IN (\'AOZCAM\',                          \'BACOSKUN\',                          \'BASEZGIN\',                          \'BECE\',                          \'BKOCADAG\',                          \'BTIMUR\',                          \'COZBAKAN\',                          \'CZGHEIB\',                          \'DAKSOY\',                          \'DISIK\',                          \'DKAHRAMANL\',                          \'EALGUL\',                          \'EARTUC\',                          \'EGURLEYEN\',                          \'EOZKAL\',                          \'EZCALIS\',                          \'FHELVACIOG\',                          \'FLOGOGLU\',                          \'FSSARIKAYA\',                          \'HBINGOL\',                          \'HCENGIZ\',                          \'HTOPTAS\',                          \'HYASSIBAS_EM\',                          \'IDEMIRTAS\',                          \'JNASR\',                          \'KABICHEDID\',                          \'KKALAANY\',                          \'KKARAGOZ\',                          \'MEVREN\',                          \'MSUSAKLI\',                          \'MUSSIMSEK\',                          \'NAKSOY\',                          \'NOYAT\',                          \'OBAYDIN\',                          \'OFSACIOBANU\',                          \'OFSACOLNICEANU\',                          \'OFSAMARASOIU\',                          \'OFSAMIHAI\',                          \'OFSANICULAE\',                          \'OFSAOHII\',                          \'OFSAPANTILIE\',                          \'OKARACA\',                          \'OMCETIN\',                          \'ONBOZKAYA\',                          \'OPERCIN\',                          \'OSARICAOGL\',                          \'OYURDUSEV\',                          \'OZGDURAK\',                          \'PEKMEKCI\',                          \'PIYALDIZ\',                          \'SBAYRAKTAR\',                          \'SDESEN\',                          \'SEONEY\',                          \'SKIZILKAYA\',                          \'SOFLAS\',                          \'SOZORAL\',                          \'SSAROHAN\',                          \'SSUSLER\',                          \'TAKTURK\',                          \'TKASDAS\',                          \'TSAYAN\',                          \'TUVURAL\',                          \'UEMRE\',                          \'VDEMIR\',                          \'YBOZCAM\')','Developers and analysts are correctly granted to system privileges\r','Developers and analysts are no correctly granted to system privileges. Revoke the grants mentioned in detail part','pass',NULL,NULL,'2026-01-01 12:46:43'),(13,202601,2,105,'AA_Oracle_430_system privileges granted to PUBLIC ROLE','critical','OTHER','This test checks for application roles that have been granted to PUBLIC. Permissions granted to PUBLIC are granted to all users of the database. Custom roles should be used to assign application permissions to functional groups of application users. The installation of Oracle does not assign role permissions to PUBLIC. Application role permissions should not be assigned to the Oracle PUBLIC role.','','select count(*)      FROM dba_sys_privs where grantee =\'PUBLIC\'','== 0','','SELECT privilege     FROM dba_sys_privs where grantee =\'PUBLIC\'','There is no any system privilege which is granted to PUBLIC role\r','There are some system privileges which are granted to PUBLIC role. Revoke all these privileges','pass',NULL,NULL,'2026-01-01 12:46:44'),(14,202601,2,106,'AA_Oracle_440_11_object privileges granted to PUBLIC role','critical','OTHER','Permissions on objects may be granted to the user group PUBLIC. Because every database user is a member of the PUBLIC group, granting object permissions to PUBLIC gives all users in the database access to that object. In a secure environment, granting object permissions to PUBLIC should be restricted to those objects that all users are allowed to access. The policy does not require object permissions assigned to PUBLIC by the installation of Oracle Database server components be revoked. Object permissions granted to PUBLIC should be restricted.','','SELECT count(*)     FROM dba_tab_privs where grantee =\'PUBLIC\'                AND OWNER NOT IN              (   \'MF_DBSPI\',   \'ANONYMOUS\',   \'CTXSYS\',   \'DBSNMP\',   \'EXFSYS\',   \'LBACSYS\',   \'MDSYS\',   \'MGMT_VIEW\',   \'OLAPSYS\',   \'OWBSYS\',   \'ORDPLUGINS\',   \'ORDSYS\',   \'OUTLN\',   \'SI_INFORMTN_SCHEMA\',   \'SYS\',   \'SYSMAN\',   \'SYSTEM\',   \'TSMSYS\',   \'WK_TEST\',   \'WKSYS\',   \'WKPROXY\',   \'WMSYS\',   \'XDB\',   \'APEX_PUBLIC_USER\',   \'DIP\',   \'FLOWS_30000\',   \'FLOWS_FILES\',   \'MDDATA\',   \'ORACLE_OCM\',   \'SPATIAL_CSW_ADMIN_USR\',   \'SPATIAL_WFS_ADMIN_USR\',   \'XS$NULL\',   \'OWBSYS_AUDIT\',   \'ORDDATA\',   \'APEX_030200\',   \'APPQOSSYS\',   \'DVSYS\',   \'DVF\',   \'CONNECT\',   \'RESOURCE\',   \'DBA\',   \'PDB_DBA\',   \'AUDIT_ADMIN\',   \'AUDIT_VIEWER\',   \'SELECT_CATALOG_ROLE\',   \'EXECUTE_CATALOG_ROLE\',   \'CAPTURE_ADMIN\',   \'EXP_FULL_DATABASE\',   \'IMP_FULL_DATABASE\',   \'CDB_DBA\',   \'APPLICATION_TRACE_VIEWER\',   \'LOGSTDBY_ADMINISTRATOR\',   \'DBFS_ROLE\',   \'GSMUSER_ROLE\',   \'GSMROOTUSER_ROLE\', 