\')          AND GRANTEE NOT IN (SELECT ROLE                                FROM DBA_ROLES                               WHERE ORACLE_MAINTAINED = \'Y\')   AND GRANTEE not like \'APEX%\'','== 0','','SELECT \'Grantee : \'||GRANTEE||\' , \'||\'PRIVILEGE : \'||PRIVILEGE     FROM DBA_SYS_PRIVS    WHERE     ADMIN_OPTION = \'YES\'          AND GRANTEE NOT IN (SELECT USERNAME                                FROM DBA_USERS                               WHERE ORACLE_MAINTAINED = \'Y\')          AND GRANTEE NOT IN (SELECT ROLE                                FROM DBA_ROLES                               WHERE ORACLE_MAINTAINED = \'Y\')   AND GRANTEE not like \'APEX%\'','The  ADMIN option for system privs is correctly set . \r','The  ADMIN option for system privs is  not correctly set .  Remove this privileges and grant them without admin option','pass',NULL,NULL,'2026-01-16 15:16:27'),(1033,202601,26,102,'AA_Oracle_410_11_WITH GRANT OPTION privileges','major','PRIV','An account permission to grant privileges within the database is an administrative function. Minimizing the number and privileges of administrative accounts reduces the chances of privileged account exploitation. Application user accounts should never require WITH GRANT OPTION privileges since, by definition, they require only privileges to execute procedures or view / edit data. Oracle WITH GRANT OPTION privilege should not be granted to non-DBA or non-Application administrator user accounts. This test excludes dba object owners and grantees with DBA role. ','','Select count(*)     FROM DBA_TAB_PRIVS    WHERE     GRANTABLE = \'YES\'    AND grantee NOT IN  (   \'MF_DBSPI\',   \'ANONYMOUS\',   \'CTXSYS\',   \'DBSNMP\',   \'EXFSYS\',   \'LBACSYS\',   \'MDSYS\',   \'MGMT_VIEW\',   \'OLAPSYS\',   \'OWBSYS\',   \'ORDPLUGINS\',   \'ORDSYS\',   \'OUTLN\',   \'SI_INFORMTN_SCHEMA\',   \'SYS\',   \'SYSMAN\',   \'SYSTEM\',   \'TSMSYS\',   \'WK_TEST\',   \'WKSYS\',   \'WKPROXY\',   \'WMSYS\',   \'XDB\',   \'APEX_PUBLIC_USER\', 