ation. Application user accounts should never require WITH GRANT OPTION privileges since, by definition, they require only privileges to execute procedures or view / edit data. Oracle WITH GRANT OPTION privilege should not be granted to non-DBA or non-Application administrator user accounts. This test excludes dba object owners and grantees with DBA role. ','','Select  count(*)     FROM DBA_TAB_PRIVS    WHERE     GRANTABLE = \'YES\'    AND   GRANTEE NOT IN (SELECT USERNAME                                FROM DBA_USERS                               WHERE ORACLE_MAINTAINED = \'Y\')          AND GRANTEE NOT IN (SELECT ROLE                                FROM DBA_ROLES                               WHERE ORACLE_MAINTAINED = \'Y\')          AND GRANTEE not in (\'PUBLIC\')          AND GRANTEE not like \'APEX%\'','== 0','','SELECT \'Grantee : \'||GRANTEE||\' , \'||\'PRIVILEGE : \'||PRIVILEGE     FROM DBA_TAB_PRIVS    WHERE     GRANTABLE = \'YES\'    AND   GRANTEE NOT IN (SELECT USERNAME                                FROM DBA_USERS                               WHERE ORACLE_MAINTAINED = \'Y\')          AND GRANTEE NOT IN (SELECT ROLE                                FROM DBA_ROLES                               WHERE ORACLE_MAINTAINED = \'Y\')          AND GRANTEE not in (\'PUBLIC\')         AND GRANTEE not like \'APEX%\'','The  WITH GRANT OPTION  option for privileges are correctly set . \r','The  WITH GRANT OPTION  option for privileges are not correctly set . Remove this privileges and grant them without  WITH GRANT OPTION option except view grants.','pass',NULL,NULL,'2026-01-16 15:16:33'),(1035,202601,26,57,'AA_Oracle_130_11_No authorization to BECOME USER','minor','PRIV','This test checks for grants to users of the system privilege BECOME USER . This privilege allows a user to inherit or alter the rights of another Oracle user; this is a powerful privilege that should only be granted when absolutely necessary.   CIS Oracle Database 4.5.3','','SELECT count(*)   FROM DBA_