moved','Imported from CSV: tests-cvs.csv','2025-12-18 08:51:45','2026-01-11 16:33:38'),(112,'AA_Oracle_480_12_No Quota on SYSTEM and SYSAUX Tablespaces','oracle','major','CONFIG','This test checks for quota grants on SYSTEM and SYSAUX tablespaces.  The Oracle SYSTEM and SYSAUX tablespace is used by the database to store all DBMS system objects. Other uses of the system tablespace may compromise system availability and the effectiveness of host system access controls to the tablespace files','','SELECT count(*)       FROM DBA_TS_QUOTAS where        tablespace_name in (\'SYSTEM\',\'SYSAUX\') and        username   NOT IN (SELECT USERNAME                                 FROM DBA_USERS                                WHERE ORACLE_MAINTAINED = \'Y\')','== 0','','SELECT username       FROM DBA_TS_QUOTAS where        tablespace_name in (\'SYSTEM\',\'SYSAUX\') and        username   NOT IN (SELECT USERNAME                                 FROM DBA_USERS                                WHERE ORACLE_MAINTAINED = \'Y\')','There is no quota on SYSTEM and SYSAUX Tablespaces\r','There are some no quotas on SYSTEM and SYSAUX Tablespaces.  These quotas should be removed','Imported from CSV: tests-cvs.csv','2025-12-18 08:51:45','2026-01-11 16:33:38'),(113,'AA_Oracle_490_PUBLIC DB Links','oracle','critical','CONFIG','This test checks for PUBLIC DB links. All users can use Public DB links without any grants. Therefore Public DB links usage should not be used','','SELECT COUNT (*)     FROM DBA_DB_LINKS    WHERE OWNER = \'PUBLIC\' AND USERNAME IS NOT NULL','== 0','','SELECT    \'OWNER: \'          || OWNER          || \' DB_LINK : \'          || DB_LINK          || \'  USERNAME : \'          || USERNAME          || \'  HOST : \'          || HOST     FROM DBA_DB_LINKS    WHERE OWNER = \'PUBLIC\' AND USERNAME IS NOT NULL','Public DB link is not found in the database.\r','Some public DB links are found in the database. These links should be removed.','Imported from CSV: tests-cvs.csv','2025-12-18 08:51:45','2026-01-11 16:33:38'),(114,'AA_Oracle_500_DB Links to test environments','oracle','major','CONFIG','This test checks for DB links which link to test , dev, uat environments. This kind of DB links should not be found in Live databases','','SELECT COUNT(*) FROM DBA_DB_LINKS  WHERE   (   UPPER (HOST) LIKE \'%TEST%\' OR   UPPER (HOST) LIKE \'%DEV%\' OR   UPPER (HOST) LIKE \'%TST%\' OR   UPPER (HOST) LIKE \'%UAT%\'   )   ','== 0','','SELECT    \'OWNER: \'          || OWNER          || \' DB_LINK : \'          || DB_LINK          || \'  USERNAME : \'          || USERNAME          || \'  HOST : \'          || HOST    from dba_db_links     WHERE   (   UPPER (HOST) LIKE \'%TEST%\' OR   UPPER (HOST) LIKE \'%DEV%\' OR   UPPER (HOST) LIKE \'%TST%\' OR   UPPER (HOST) LIKE \'%UAT%\'   )','There is no DB link which points to test environments in the database.\r','In the live database, there are some DB links which point to Test environments. Drop these links','Imported from CSV: tests-cvs.csv','2025-12-18 08:51:45','2026-01-11 16:33:38'),(115,'AA_Oracle_505_Personal user DB links','oracle','critical','CONFIG','This test checks for DB links which are defined in personal users. Personal users should not have any DB links.','','select count(*) from dba_db_links where   owner in (   \'AOZCAM\',   \'BACOSKUN\',   \'BASEZGIN\',   \'BECE\',   \'BKOCADAG\',   \'BTIMUR\',   \'COZBAKAN\',   \'CZGHEIB\',   \'DAKSOY\',   \'DISIK\',   \'DKAHRAMANL\',   \'EALGUL\',   \'EARTUC\',   \'EGURLEYEN\',   \'EOZKAL\',   \'EZCALIS\',   \'FHELVACIOG\',   \'FLOGOGLU\',   \'FSSARIKAYA\',   \'HBINGOL\',   \'HCENGIZ\',   \'HTOPTAS\',   \'HYASSIBAS_EM\',   \'IDEMIRTAS\',   \'JNASR\',   \'KABICHEDID\',   \'KKALAANY\',   \'KKARAGOZ\',   \'MEVREN\',   \'MSUSAKLI\',   \'MUSSIMSEK\',   \'NAKSOY\',   \'NOYAT\',   \'OBAYDIN\',   \'OFSACIOBANU\',   \'OFSACOLNICEANU\',   \'OFSAMARASOIU\',   \'OFSAMIHAI\',   \'OFSANICULAE\',   \'OFSAOHII\',   \'OFSAPANTILIE\',   \'OKARACA\',   \'OMCETIN\',   \'ONBOZKAYA\',